            <div xml:id="m-6dbb968e-b050-42aa-a18c-d2844e7c2e22">
              <lg xml:id="m-b6143736-abb1-4b27-93d2-75285317c8e3">
                <l xml:id="m-422c8c1b-39a4-4340-a840-73aa6811ba91" facs="#m-a2c9dd54-7022-4d0c-acab-7ccc4aadb3fe" label="ambiguous">Ember Wednesday.</l><l xml:id="m-2570b81d-c5c8-413e-b8a3-557d5acec7c5" facs="#m-0c822d5d-447d-4b70-9371-ba9faa6cd864" label="ambiguous">894</l><l xml:id="m-da14e550-5b63-41d7-971d-89423a04fcda" facs="#m-1132cbbd-6b0f-4e30-887d-c14ed0fb6f65" label="lyrics-like">li fir-má-ti sunt, et Spí¬ ritu</l><l xml:id="m-018db587-6e34-4b97-abbc-e912780774fd" facs="#m-8f3262c6-8ac0-417c-b0e1-281cb25b3738" label="lyrics-like">mi-ni caé¬</l><l xml:id="m-02c61c4b-b0d2-4caf-b42c-19a7c0ac4745" facs="#m-dff10c4f-3001-463b-9197-a7768fed9d9b" label="lyrics-like">6́-ris</l><l xml:id="m-3c86352c-02a8-4750-9a34-32f3c4b5ee49" facs="#m-d338c481-5d9e-48ca-8613-10a7f44b7f75" label="lyrics-like">é¬</l><l xml:id="m-17f8bfb4-9234-4b95-9fdb-ab4b561f7a02" facs="#m-88810aac-6121-4ad5-b085-beeddb132dbd" label="lyrics-like">jus ómnis vírtus “ e- órum.</l><l xml:id="m-b62ca230-8536-4277-a5ed-d16c961cb9a4" facs="#m-296265b5-b59b-4945-b657-87e3d84fd66b" label="lyrics-like">Alleldia. is not repeated. The Glória in excélsis. is said here.</l><l xml:id="m-cc10ebd8-61be-4d8a-a0a8-07d800f799a0" facs="#m-e80d9935-7498-4f3d-bc79-1c3367846c54" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-223fd3fa-2a5c-436d-88d4-9cb07de737b2" facs="#m-aad1e496-2702-4f80-b79d-30d76d6a1033" label="lyrics-like">DRaesta, quaésumus omnípotens! glóriae suae dignánter inhabitándo</l><l xml:id="m-7e4a9589-bceb-433e-bb0f-381ca67d479a" facs="#m-6b8a41fa-3288-429b-8e1c-5ca8ace7fb50" label="lyrics-like">et miséricors Deus:* ut Spiritus ! perficiat. Per Dóminum... in uni¬</l><l xml:id="m-29d70010-7ce0-4f16-bbc2-3e0ec6d6ee80" facs="#m-e746ae0f-5e37-4147-a2d2-23b30a2d55c6" label="lyrics-like">Sanctus advéniens, templum nosl tâte ejúsdem Spiritus Sancti Deus.</l><l xml:id="m-ad0e6d45-6a9a-40cb-9feb-e39a445f4aae" facs="#m-7c18fc72-84ce-4cea-ad97-35e352717206" label="text-like">2. for the Church or for the Pope, 319.</l><l xml:id="m-f93925e8-5cbf-4e5b-8825-4c77308c778e" facs="#m-59c0abc0-4f7e-4e3b-9155-1cfbcc111de1" label="ambiguous">Lectio Actuum Apostolorum. Act. 5. b.</l><l xml:id="m-e1055ab6-0180-44b5-ab3b-a9d39fc87bbd" facs="#m-ba2722b4-2fef-4b54-9427-00494ec1ef89" label="lyrics-like">N diébus illis: Per manus autem! infirmos, et pónerent in léctulis ac</l><l xml:id="m-3542c52a-a5e8-41a4-a509-e2ed4df3a416" facs="#m-19185292-686e-4bf1-831f-0e1d60ab6f0c" label="lyrics-like">L Apostolórum fiébant signa et! grabátis, ut, veniénte Petro, saltem</l><l xml:id="m-29c6c272-3a1d-4125-b23a-2ef792dbc44c" facs="#m-12069508-640a-4a14-9deb-af449665b3c1" label="ambiguous">prodigia multa in plebe. Et erant</l><l xml:id="m-a18360eb-3aeb-4b32-aec2-980022452721" facs="#m-8f5b69d3-fa13-46b2-afe3-04bdd6c48e6a" label="lyrics-like">umbra illíus obumbráret quemquam</l><l xml:id="m-18985a82-ca7b-4dbe-8872-e9a476fe1fdc" facs="#m-c4f95ce9-1a9e-4ce5-b273-cd7c0117edac" label="lyrics-like">unanimiter omnes in pórticu Salo¬</l><l xml:id="m-e5842d11-d764-43c8-9241-d32028f49e59" facs="#m-f6882660-2ea9-43b9-8248-4e0c58904c50" label="lyrics-like">illórum, et liberaréntur ab infirmitá¬</l><l xml:id="m-29119feb-3d26-4840-9b7a-b14dd4f4d78b" facs="#m-eb847eff-41a2-46dd-aa09-c7f1cf06ee38" label="lyrics-like">mónis. Ceterórum autem nemo</l><l xml:id="m-449353f4-21f0-4dfb-a49f-37c3f41b38df" facs="#m-d763b1b7-0156-48c9-bf45-b96f114d5c6f" label="lyrics-like">tibus suis. Concurrébat autem et</l><l xml:id="m-379d0c20-004f-49db-8010-f571184183af" facs="#m-af23c6e9-be3b-49db-8ad8-602ab54f96c2" label="lyrics-like">multitúdo vicinárum civitátum Je¬</l><l xml:id="m-e9cd335f-212a-4e66-8073-895eb8ee1a94" facs="#m-5d151927-0a34-4d6d-8712-f54db2ba4c09" label="lyrics-like">audébat se conjúngere illis: ed</l><l xml:id="m-dd455e4f-9bbd-4d6e-b155-7aaceb7776cf" facs="#m-d397a336-f779-4788-b7d7-2c0e4e08f9f0" label="lyrics-like">magnificábat eos pópulus. Magis</l><l xml:id="m-ca988455-1bdb-4d05-ad4a-b677aceec788" facs="#m-4f8f5be5-6f1f-4dd5-8d84-7f1e03212ff1" label="lyrics-like">rúsalem, afferéntes aegros, et ve¬</l><l xml:id="m-ac7f5cec-251e-4dd4-bdf5-598f067058e3" facs="#m-8dde3bb4-2533-47ef-bacf-392be6323e58" label="lyrics-like">xátos a spiritibus immúndis: qui</l><l xml:id="m-6e500b1b-d0ce-445b-ae35-25f512aacd61" facs="#m-65b79ffe-1eb0-4a1d-8bc1-9e655ce37d98" label="lyrics-like">autem augebátur credéntium in</l><l xml:id="m-1843058e-522c-49c4-9bf6-88da642f9e1a" facs="#m-e3439813-296a-4ce3-b6ec-076c30028e1e" label="lyrics-like">Dómino múltitúdo virórum ac mu- curabántur omnes.</l><l xml:id="m-58abb9f2-5da8-4669-8c44-51ad0f634401" facs="#m-78382d42-089d-4650-a7e2-1b1cd25e38a0" label="lyrics-like">lierum, ita ut in platéas ejicerent</l><l xml:id="m-a08eaa87-dbbc-4975-8d26-3c66491d5f1d" facs="#m-6224a6a8-f4fc-4a29-98dd-ca96ec27cfa0" label="lyrics-like">Allelúia, allelúia. V. Véni Sáncte Spiritus. p. 880.</l><l xml:id="m-222e3aca-fac0-41b1-9f32-1cfae11b0dd8" facs="#m-a63e20ba-e190-4acb-a55e-ff7b45d97cc4" label="lyrics-like">Sequence. Véni Sáncte Spiritus. Allelúia. D. 880.</l><l xml:id="m-ecd74eb3-5128-4556-a589-1e4a57740475" facs="#m-63b23e06-ebf9-4670-84e2-1e89fa808979" label="lyrics-like">1 Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Joannem. Joañ. 6. e.</l><l xml:id="m-602b34f4-903b-496d-8bc0-65fa1caa7050" facs="#m-f5eee125-83bb-410d-a04a-18bba0ac81cc" label="lyrics-like">N illo témpore: Dixit Jesus tur-l vitam aetérnam. Ego sum panis</l><l xml:id="m-7c022d81-0333-4fc0-84e7-7a2c73141980" facs="#m-6acfbcd4-1f7f-4bc4-80e1-03039d86693a" label="lyrics-like">Lbis Judacórum: Nemo potest</l><l xml:id="m-42b58ee9-fd26-4ff2-b995-673f52106ad2" facs="#m-2d7a516d-a9cf-4146-b741-241572a2a86f" label="lyrics-like">vitae. Patres vestri manducavérunt</l><l xml:id="m-3e8fc845-5d15-43e8-827a-023b7a5f4008" facs="#m-8cf27a4c-b4bf-4b7b-a7d5-bfd9698b099a" label="lyrics-like">venfre ãd me, nisi Pater, qui misit ] manna in desérto, et mórtui sunt.</l><l xml:id="m-563d1c12-f3a2-445c-8ed6-c749b6a34e3f" facs="#m-b8e78671-5a60-48db-977c-e9c29c11814e" label="lyrics-like">Hic est panis de caelo descéndens:</l><l xml:id="m-aae889ee-024c-43a8-abc0-686b6a448885" facs="#m-253eda02-c3f1-43be-9931-8f30129e7521" label="lyrics-like">me, tráxerit eum: et ego resusci¬</l><l xml:id="m-9aa27d74-db29-4281-9d3c-0c4e774ea3a8" facs="#m-a63525c5-fd27-4950-aaa0-646831636a6a" label="lyrics-like">ut si quis ex ipso manducáverit,</l><l xml:id="m-61b834fd-3fc9-4b07-9579-bc57c52fe08a" facs="#m-db888ccc-dc5a-4b54-9fed-733907db37c7" label="lyrics-like">tábo eum in novíssimo die. Est</l><l xml:id="m-6ee7e925-977a-463e-bf4f-ea3f582be4a0" facs="#m-cbecef01-df79-47f5-b133-114c630c88e5" label="lyrics-like">scriptum in prophétis: Et erunt</l><l xml:id="m-ac9028aa-1316-418c-8c29-1e51a9472895" facs="#m-36c095b2-4df1-41c0-ba94-3d6f04b038d5" label="lyrics-like">non moriátur. Égo sum panis vi¬</l><l xml:id="m-2a032c8f-4219-44a3-bb96-8a3464481817" facs="#m-c4fc7263-6351-4d48-81f1-e8cacf46ab4a" label="ambiguous">omnes docibiles Dei. Omnis, qui</l><l xml:id="m-341c6cc3-e0ce-4881-8f2c-fa585f07fc44" facs="#m-65fff23a-8af8-4d01-b9b9-e0a2c35eb745" label="lyrics-like">vus, qui de caelo descéndi. Si quis</l><l xml:id="m-1712339e-7800-42d7-8bd0-0b72ad7a0a3e" facs="#m-686df51d-43b2-45a2-a7c8-e15d8b4cc103" label="ambiguous">audsvit a Patre, et didicit, venit ad</l><l xml:id="m-e2ca5682-3f48-43b0-bc8f-440a13ada7f2" facs="#m-d0888959-a36e-4157-a93f-ccf5168b463a" label="lyrics-like">manducáverit ex hoc pane, vivet</l><l xml:id="m-5bbf1743-2d41-49ec-b7e9-642b115eb09b" facs="#m-56f3dd36-2a98-4b80-b755-31c40da7d1e5" label="ambiguous">me. Non quia Patrem vidit quis¬</l><l xml:id="m-3e6cbc9a-56af-414e-a0e3-242547622de4" facs="#m-337a0e53-6817-4734-bb33-c140c8607ab3" label="lyrics-like">in aetérnum: et panis, quem ego</l><l xml:id="m-5c3aa8d0-95c7-43c7-91d4-846888427ecd" facs="#m-eb6ab1aa-7fc1-4f5d-bde6-a71fdbb94373" label="text-like">quam, nisi is, qui est a Deo, hic</l><l xml:id="m-a4c236de-66ea-4ae3-bb82-7cc4947986e7" facs="#m-2327393a-26bc-4479-9f29-73113698b632" label="ambiguous">dabo, caro mea est pro mundi vita.</l><l xml:id="m-6b800619-8524-4891-871e-b7236d39e64d" facs="#m-41e67ddc-bb00-4056-a9f0-01377c053f77" label="ambiguous">vidit Patrem. Amen, amen dico</l><l xml:id="m-76b16e85-5b4e-4344-b9a6-0d68eed32e46" facs="#m-5fd9cd31-8634-4409-bce1-0ff1c1270117" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-8b3e16d7-aede-4aeb-88d5-58bca16e182e" facs="#m-2facb905-aee1-4843-84a3-3f9ab2f53007" label="ambiguous">vobis: qui credit in me, habet</l><l xml:id="m-7414027a-d022-4b22-9379-995676ad0e5d" facs="#m-67848a67-09c3-4cdf-9424-56f207ab74bc" label="ambiguous">orert.</l><l xml:id="m-ad2488a3-ae3c-4610-861d-ca4d9a479122" facs="#m-f84c1a1b-9807-4e55-9418-28aeb5f8e90b" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-88a012af-80a5-4ca7-8dd8-ea5f55a52fff" facs="#m-e0340e5e-bd30-4d15-b516-66bbaf9e9cce" label="ambiguous">Eaa</l><l xml:id="m-fd91a912-7f77-49c0-a76c-b0cb130d295d" facs="#m-dff89c28-2458-4b22-8bb4-dafbd4571999" label="lyrics-like">bor"in mandá¬ tis</l><l xml:id="m-41404fc3-fccb-4722-8687-8b44217625fe" facs="#m-45969575-b256-4b5c-bf0d-2701cdaed256" label="lyrics-like">tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-f966ca2c-54e1-4131-8268-db368a4248a7" facs="#m-d49d0876-ddb5-4e59-a959-88a0695e3345" label="text-like">is, quae</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>